+# Ready time (design row 20; C12, C34): scheduled at 04:45 America/Sao_Paulo (UTC-3, no daylight saving) so the day's briefing, gauges and
+# feeds are live on Pages before 06:00; the cron is re-fitted after 7-10 scheduled runs and the deploy times are recorded in the wish.
+# Push (C42, M2): the data commit is made and replayed onto dev in a step with no secret (dehype is a public repository, so the replay
