+# node or python. Not full isolation: github.token is still GH_TOKEN's fallback in "Fetch and score" and is held by the gh release steps,
+# and an earlier step can write $GITHUB_ENV, $GITHUB_PATH or .git/config (include.path, url.*.insteadOf) that the push step inherits.
